{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13767","headline":"谅公洞庭孤橘歌 · 顾况","name":"谅公洞庭孤橘歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不种自生一株橘，谁敎渠向堦前出。\n不羡江陵千木奴，下生白蚁子，上生青雀雏。\n飞花檐卜旃檀香，结实如缀摩尼珠。\n洞庭橘树笼烟碧，洞庭波月连沙白。\n待取天公放恩赦，侬家定作湖中客。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}